 "note": "Hand-staged from the text in the megaron at dinner: the beggar by the threshold wall, Ctesippus in the middle of the hall with an ox's foot from the meat basket, Telemachus by his father's seat, three suitors at the tables (added to the forage's cast by film-readymades/staging.py). The hoof thrown (K2: THROW with a prop flight and smear bricks, as the Stool's take 3), the beggar's head turned aside and down, the hoof against the wall and on the floor (K2a), the suitors' laughter, Telemachus forward with his threat (K3). The card's own ox hoof piece is hidden; the keyframes stage the hoof (tools/forage/keyprops.js oxHoof).",
